uka. \"Do you want to peer deeper?\" After Nina says this, Haruka is taken to a magical space.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8465324/screencap/613e8277f1022.jpg"},{"title":"Mana \"Color\"","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16318","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"134120","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49066","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"404002","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"52361","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Mana \"Color\"","synopsis":"Mana is your typical college student. She prioritizes being like everyone else, but also holds a secret social media account where she shares her music activities. But one day she comes across a hateful comment about her music. All of a sudden in an alley, the wall behind her turns into a door which leads her to a shop owned by the witch Nina.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8465325/screencap/613e88c58f58f.jpg","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Mana is your typical college student. She prioritizes being like everyone else, but also holds a secret social media account where she shares her music activities. But one day she comes across a hateful comment about her music. All of a sudden in an alley, the wall behind her turns into a door which leads her to a shop owned by the witch Nina.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8465325/screencap/613e88c58f58f.jpg"},{"title":"Akihiro \"Look at Me\"","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16318","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"134120","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49066","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"404002","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"52587","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Akihiro \"Look at Me\"","synopsis":"Akihiro is a fashion school student. Believing he is talented, he lives his life looking down on others, but he shrinks at the slightest of confrontations, and he's unable to speak his mind with his classmates as well. One day, he is talking to himself as he thinks about his own brand design when a young man misunderstands the situation and approaches Akihiro. Akihiro frantically runs into an alley when he sees a strange door in front of him, the door leading to Nina's shop.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8465326/screencap/613e8ba946e78.jpg","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Akihiro is a fashion school student. Believing he is talented, he lives his life looking down on others, but he shrinks at the slightest of confrontations, and he's unable to speak his mind with his classmates as well. One day, he is talking to himself as he thinks about his own brand design when a young man misunderstands the situation and approaches Akihiro. Akihiro frantically runs into an alley when he sees a strange door in front of him, the door leading to Nina's shop.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/8465326/screencap/613e8ba946e78.jpg"},{"title":"Ruru \"Ghost Food\"","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16318","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"134120","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"49066","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"404002","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"53131","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Ruru \"Ghost Food\"","synopsis":"Nina has gained more confidence as a witch after helping several people sort through their issues. That's when Ruru arrived to Nina's shop clad in the latest Lolita fashion, overcome by her distain for the world filled with things she hated.","thumbnail":"https://artwo